# A variant's emblem is in its player's command zone before the game begins, as a vanguard card is (CR 902.3), and its
# abilities function from there (CR 114.4, 902.7). Bot1 begins with Chandra, Awakened Inferno's emblem: at the beginning
# of each of its upkeeps it deals 1 damage to Bot1, turn one's included. Bot2 begins with none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest x40

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Variant]
Bot1: emblem Chandra, Awakened Inferno emblem

[Actions]
? Bot1.Emblems.Count = 1
? Stack = Chandra, Awakened Inferno emblem
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Life = 19
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Emblems.Count = 1
Bot2.Emblems.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 20
